  "staticData": null,
  "meta": {
    "description": "WS-04 Phase 1 milestone: triggered by the backend's upload-trigger callback (N8N_WEBHOOK_URL -> POST /webhook/document-uploaded, {document_id}). Calls the single internal endpoint that dispatches the whole Celery processing chain (validate -> OCR -> extract -> embed). n8n never touches the broker or application tables directly (ADR-009). Idempotent: every task in the dispatched chain re-checks the document's current status before acting, so duplicate webhook delivery for the same document_id is a safe no-op, not a duplicate run."
  },
